# The Discord app behind "muted / deafened" in the island (Windows).
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env`, in this same folder (next to CMakeLists.txt). `.env` is ignored by git.
# 2. Fill in the two values from https://discord.com/developers/applications
#    (your app -> General Information -> Application ID; OAuth2 -> Client Secret).
#    Under OAuth2 -> Redirects add:  http://localhost
# 3. Run CMake again (cmake -B build ...). The values are compiled into your own build only.
#
# Never commit `.env`. For releases, put the same two values in the GitHub repository secrets
# DISCORD_CLIENT_ID and DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET instead (the Windows workflow passes them on).
# Leave them empty to build without the feature: Settings then says it is unavailable.

NOTCH_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
NOTCH_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=
